{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56614","headline":"籍田赋附田父歌 · 无名氏","name":"籍田赋附田父歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"畇畇千亩兮理有疆，济济千耦兮稷既良。\n躬三推兮供神苍，分九鳸兮应农祥。\n栥盛普淖兮洁敬斯皇，神之昕之兮将登穰穰。\n（见同书卷七○缺名《籍田赋》附。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}